window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>The Stars Couldn't Break Us</i> is a fantasy romance novella set in the world of The Stars Would Curse Us and should be listened to after Book 1.</p> <p>Two lost hearts, an arranged marriage, and more than a social divide between them.</p> <p>Can he survive the loss of his mate and open his heart to someone new? Can she let go of her past and break through the walls he put up to keep her out?</p> <p>Return to Iveria in this emotional and heartwarming installment in The Stars Would Curse Us series.</p> <p>Perfect for fans of:</p> <ul> <li>arranged marriage</li> <li>only one seahorse</li> <li>grumpy x sunshine</li> <li>reluctant lovers</li> </ul>"; 
